---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" activeStep={0} hideSteps={true}>

<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  .me-page {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 56px);
  }

  /* LEFT */
  .me-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 80px 60px;
    border-right: 2px solid #111;
    position: relative;
  }

  .me-blocks {
    position: relative;
    width: 320px;
    height: 320px;
  }

  .me-block {
    position: absolute;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Black Han Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    letter-spacing: .05em;
    border: 2px solid #111;
  }

  .me-block-about {
    width: 160px; height: 80px;
    background: #5a7a9f; color: #fff;
    top: 0; left: 0;
  }

  .me-block-this {
    width: 220px; height: 160px;
    background: #e8c94a; color: #111;
    font-size: 56px;
    top: 60px; left: 40px;
  }

  .me-block-project {
    width: 180px; height: 80px;
    background: #c94a35; color: #fff;
    top: 200px; left: 100px;
  }

  /* Close button */
  .me-close {
    position: fixed;
    top: 70px;
    right: 24px;
    font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: .15em;
    color: #aaa;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    z-index: 50;
    transition: color .15s;
  }
  .me-close:hover { color: #111; }

  /* RIGHT */
  .me-right {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 80px 60px;
  }

  .me-text {
    max-width: 400px;
  }

  .me-text p {
    font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 2;
    color: #333;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    letter-spacing: .02em;
  }

  .me-text p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .me-cta {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding-top: 32px;
    border-top: 1px solid #e0ddd7;
  }

  .me-cta-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    background: #e8c94a;
    border: 2px solid #111;
    font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: .15em;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #111;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background .15s;
  }
  .me-cta-btn:hover { background: #d4b535; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .me-page { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .me-left {
      border-right: none;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #111;
      padding: 60px 40px;
    }
    .me-right { padding: 40px 24px; }
    .me-blocks { width: 260px; height: 260px; }
    .me-block-about { width: 130px; height: 65px; font-size: 22px; }
    .me-block-this { width: 180px; height: 130px; font-size: 44px; top: 50px; left: 30px; }
    .me-block-project { width: 150px; height: 65px; font-size: 22px; top: 160px; left: 80px; }
  }
</style>

<a href="/" class="me-close">CLOSE</a>

<div class="me-page">

  <!-- LEFT -->
  <div class="me-left">
    <div class="me-blocks">
      <div class="me-block me-block-about">ABOUT</div>
      <div class="me-block me-block-this">THIS</div>
      <div class="me-block me-block-project">PROJECT</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- RIGHT -->
  <div class="me-right">
    <div class="me-text">
      <p>I studied to be a barista a few years ago. Before that, I had studied chemistry, so I already had that curiosity about extractions, mixtures, and proportions.</p>
      <p>I still make coffee. I try things, change something, try again. Sometimes it turns out better, sometimes not so much.</p>
      <p>Over time, something became clear: coffee on your own loses interest.</p>
      <p>The taste doesn't change. The experience does.</p>
      <p>That's where this idea comes from. Making coffee at the same time, each in our own place, knowing there's someone learning how to prepare their favorite recipe.</p>
      <p>It doesn't take much.</p>
      <p>Coffee, and someone on the other side, giving meaning to everything I learned in my barista course.</p>
      <p>If the idea appeals to you, I'd love for us to make coffee together.</p>

      <div class="me-cta">
        <a href="/recipes" class="me-cta-btn">
          START BREWING →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

</Layout>